### Task 1 Instances

:AirbusA320NEOSpec-1 rdf:type :ArtifactDesign ;
    rdfs:label "Airbus A320 NEO Spec-1"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000136 :AirbusA320NEO .


### Here I opted to create an individual of the Airbus A320 Neo type that holds the required attributes. Not strictly correct, but I'm not sure about building the OWL anonymous class (yet)
:AirbusA320NEO rdf:type :FixedWing ;
    rdfs:label "Airbus A320 NEO"@en ;
    obo:BFO_0000178 :Engine1 , 
                :Engine2 ;
    :hasmanufacturer :Airbus ;
    :hasModelBADA "Airbus A320-271N"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasModelFAA "Airbus A320 Neo"^^xsd:string ;
    :haslengthft "123.3"^^xsd:decimal ;
    :hastailheightft "39.6"^^xsd:decimal .

:Engine1 rdf:type :JetEngine ;
    rdfs:label "Engine 1"@en .

:Engine2 rdf:type :JetEngine ;
    rdfs:label "Engine 2"@en .

:Airbus rdf:type :Manufacturer ;
    rdfs:label "Airbus"@en .

